WEBVTT

00:00:29.116 --> 00:00:31.116
stabbed while crocheting,

00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:32.676
or my favorite,

00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:35.196
due to extreme problems with your in-laws.

00:00:35.236 --> 00:00:37.516
(Laughter)

00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:39.956
But the best of all has got to be the code

00:00:39.996 --> 00:00:41.796
for getting sucked into a jet engine.

00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:45.676
And the reason that I like this one
is because this is not the code

00:00:45.676 --> 00:00:48.796
for the first time this happens,
but for the subsequent encounter.

00:00:48.836 --> 00:00:49.836
(Laughter)

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.676
So there must be people on this Earth

00:00:51.716 --> 00:00:53.876
that have been sucked
into a jet engine twice.

00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:56.316
(Laughter)

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:59.036
But I think, you know, kidding aside,

00:00:59.036 --> 00:01:00.356
we have to recognize